msgid ""
"The Model 44 is the carbine-sized variant of the standard 1891/30.  It has a "
"shorter barrel, making it weaker than the 1891/30, but easier to carry.  This"
" weapon also comes with an integrated side-folding bayonet."
msgstr ""

