"Developed by the Russian Empire prior to the onset of the First World War, "
"the Mosin is a bolt-action military battle rifle chambered for 7.62x54mm "
"rounds.  Powerful, unwieldy, and prolific across the world as military "
"surplus, this sizable rifle is a Soviet updated version of the venerable "
"Mosin."
