#. ~ Description of gun "Calico automatic carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Calico automatic carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid ""
"The Calico automatic carbine is a submachine gun with a unique circular "
"magazine that allows for high capacities and reduced recoil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Calico automatic carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Calico automatic carbine"
