#. ~ Description of gun "Glock carry pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Glock carry pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid ""
"A common 9x19mm pistol of modest proportions, produced by the popular Glock "
"gun company and mainly built from plastic polymers.  Making use of aptly-"
"named Glock magazines and being a decades-long popular concealed carry option"
" for civilians due to its small size, it is a tried, tested, and reliable "
"design."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Glock carry pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Glock carry pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
